<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Your account is past due by </font><font face="arial">{!Case.Payments_Behind__c}&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">payments. Are you in the position to get any of these caught up at this time</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">?</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">We can run as a lump sum or split these up if needed and run them on days of your choice. Please let me know.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Note, any payment ran past date of maturity carries an additional $10 per day fee.&nbsp;</font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.Originating_Lender_formula__c}</b></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>